            <ArticleTitle>Analysis of &quot;Seven Year Surveillance of the Clinical Performance of a Blood Glucose Test-Strip Product&quot;.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1163-1164</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
